<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>DiGiCAL - Tester Feedback</title>

    <meta name="description"
          content="Send feedback and report issues while testing DiGiCAL.">

    <meta name="theme-color" content="#111111">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family:
                -apple-system,
                BlinkMacSystemFont,
                "Segoe UI",
                Roboto,
                Helvetica,
                Arial,
                sans-serif;

            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #171717;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(800px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: auto;
        }

        /* Header */

        header {
            padding: 70px 0 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            margin: 0 auto 20px;

            border-radius: 16px;

            background: #111;
            color: white;

            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;

            font-size: clamp(34px, 7vw, 52px);
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            max-width: 600px;

            margin: 18px auto 0;

            color: #666;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        /* Card */

        .card {
            background: #fff;

            padding: 32px;

            border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            border-radius: 16px;

            box-shadow:
                0 5px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-top: 0;

            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #666;
        }

        /* Form */

        label {
            display: block;

            margin-top: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 7px;

            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        input,
        select,
        textarea {
            width: 100%;

            padding: 13px 14px;

            border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
            border-radius: 8px;

            background: #fff;

            color: #222;

            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 15px;

            outline: none;
        }

        input:focus,
        select:focus,
        textarea:focus {
            border-color: #777;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 140px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .rating {
            display: flex;

            flex-wrap: wrap;

            gap: 8px;
        }

        .rating label {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .rating input {
            display: none;
        }

        .rating span {
            display: inline-block;

            padding: 9px 15px;

            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;

            cursor: pointer;

            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .rating input:checked + span {
            background: #111;
            color: #fff;
            border-color: #111;
        }

        .submit {
            width: 100%;

            margin-top: 28px;
            padding: 14px 20px;

            border: 0;
            border-radius: 8px;

            background: #111;
            color: #fff;

            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;

            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .submit:hover {
            background: #333;
        }

        /* Information */

        .info {
            margin-top: 25px;

            padding: 20px;

            background: #f7f7f7;

            border-radius: 10px;

            color: #666;

            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .info strong {
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Footer */

        footer {
            padding: 40px 0;

            text-align: center;

            color: #888;

            font-size: 13px;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #666;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Mobile */

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            header {
                padding: 50px 0 35px;
            }

            .card {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }

            h1 {
                letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="logo">
            D
        </div>

        <h1>
            DiGiCAL Tester Feedback
        </h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            Thanks for helping us test DiGiCAL.
            Your feedback helps us find bugs, improve usability,
            and make the app better before the public release.
        </p>

    </div>

</header>


<main>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="card">

            <h2>
                Share Your Feedback
            </h2>

            <p>
                Please tell us about your experience using DiGiCAL.
                You can report bugs, suggest improvements, or simply
                tell us what you liked about the app.
            </p>


            <!--
                IMPORTANT:
                Replace the email address below with your email.

                This form uses mailto and does not require a backend.
            -->

            <form
                action="mailto:your-email@example.com"
                method="post"
                enctype="text/plain">


                <label for="name">
                    Your Name
                </label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="name"
                    name="Name"
                    placeholder="Optional">


                <label for="experience">
                    Overall Experience
                </label>

                <div class="rating">

                    <label>
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="Rating"
                            value="1 - Very Poor">
                        <span>1</span>
                    </label>

                    <label>
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="Rating"
                            value="2 - Poor">
                        <span>2</span>
                    </label>

                    <label>
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="Rating"
                            value="3 - Okay">
                        <span>3</span>
                    </label>

                    <label>
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="Rating"
                            value="4 - Good">
                        <span>4</span>
                    </label>

                    <label>
                        <input
                            type="radio"
                            name="Rating"
                            value="5 - Excellent">
                        <span>5</span>
                    </label>

                </div>


                <label for="type">
                    Feedback Type
                </label>

                <select
                    id="type"
                    name="Feedback Type">

                    <option value="General Feedback">
                        General Feedback
                    </option>

                    <option value="Bug Report">
                        Bug Report
                    </option>

                    <option value="Feature Request">
                        Feature Request
                    </option>

                    <option value="UI / Design">
                        UI / Design
                    </option>

                    <option value="Performance">
                        Performance
                    </option>

                    <option value="Calculation Issue">
                        Calculation Issue
                    </option>

                    <option value="Other">
                        Other
                    </option>

                </select>


                <label for="feedback">
                    Your Feedback
                </label>

                <textarea
                    id="feedback"
                    name="Feedback"
                    required
                    placeholder="Tell us what you experienced..."></textarea>


                <label for="device">
                    Device / Android Version
                </label>

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="device"
                    name="Device"
                    placeholder="Example: Pixel 9a, Android 16">


                <label for="steps">
                    Steps to Reproduce
                    <span style="font-weight: normal; color: #888;">
                        (for bug reports)
                    </span>
                </label>

                <textarea
                    id="steps"
                    name="Steps to Reproduce"
                    placeholder="Example:
1. Open DiGiCAL
2. Enter 100 + 20
3. Press =
4. Result is..."></textarea>


                <button
                    type="submit"
                    class="submit">

                    Send Feedback

                </button>

            </form>


            <div class="info">

                <strong>Privacy:</strong>
                Please don't include passwords, payment information,
                phone numbers, or other sensitive personal information
                in your feedback.

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</main>


<footer>

    <div class="container">

        <p>
            © 2026 TruApps Studio · DiGiCAL
        </p>

        <p>
            <a href="../">
                DiGiCAL
            </a>
            &nbsp; · &nbsp;

            <a href="../privacy-policy.html">
                Privacy Policy
            </a>
        </p>

    </div>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
